ols and  services here is a quick summary of  pubchem related topics covered in the  Karen phonetics of ACC and basically it  includes everything that I mentioned  today and more in summary a majority of  pubchem users are likely to be college  student and they use pubchem as a  reference material but there are many  other things that students can do beyond  this use case and upcam can also be used  as a free online informatics education  resource and cheminformatics olcc is a  good example and finally we are very  interested in working together with the  chemical in a chemical education  community so if you're interested please  reach out to us for collaboration thank  you and I'm more than happy to answer  your questions thank you so one will  leave it open for a couple of minutes to  see if there are any questions  looks like we do finally have a couple  of questions so let me get to those real  quick there are two questions that sort  of relate to the same thing so on  what third-party tools can be used to  replicate the SAR functions that are  going to be discontinued and to people  asked simply that question where we are  not allowed to endorse any commercial  software or third-party software so how  we cannot really answer the question in  public but if you send me an email I can  I can tell you about that  in person so one I think it's okay to if  you want to it's okay to mention some  just say specifically we don't endorse  it just an example of one it's fine you  can do that in my opinion our is the  best one because it's free and and it  runs on PC and Mac and Linux and in the  case of our there are many tutorials out  there so you can you can start from  there okay thank you  okay I don't see any additional  questions right now so thanks everybody  for coming and we're having on another  webinar next week on blast so please be  sure to check that out if you're  interested in blast thank you very much  for coming  you

